availableOffline -- which Kreuzer-Skarke items are available offline
********************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        availableOffline()
  * Outputs:
      * a *note hash table: (Macaulay2Doc)HashTable,, the keys are the h11 and
        h12 entries which are available, and the value is either a string
        containing the file name, or a pair containing the number downloaded,
        and the file name.

Description
===========

In the examples below, the calls to *note kreuzerSkarke: kreuzerSkarke, will be
handled without accessing the web interface.  If we had asked for
kreuzerSkarke(11, 24, Limit => 1000) then since only 100 are available locally,
