description -- the description header
*************************************

  * Usage: 
        description e
  * Inputs:
      * e, an *note entry from the Kreuzer-Skarke database: KSEntry,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note string: (Macaulay2Doc)String,, 

Description
===========

Returns the description header of the given entry from the Kreuzer-Skarke
database. This is simply the first line of the given entry.

+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : e = KSEntry "4 5  M:53 5 N:9 5 H:3,43 [-80] id:0|
|       1   0   2   4 -10                             |
|       0   1   3   5  -9                             |
|       0   0   4   0  -4                             |
|       0   0   0   8  -8                             |
|       ";                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : description e                                   |
|                                                     |
|o2 = 4 5  M:53 5 N:9 5 H:3,43 [-80] id:0             |
+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : A = matrix e                                    |
|                                                     |
|o3 = | 1 0 2 4 -10 |                                 |
|     | 0 1 3 5 -9  |                                 |
|     | 0 0 4 0 -4  |                                 |
|     | 0 0 0 8 -8  |                                 |
|                                                     |
|              4       5                              |
|o3 : Matrix ZZ  <-- ZZ                               |
+-----------------------------------------------------+

