toString(KSEntry) -- the underlying string of a KSEntry
*******************************************************

  * Function: *note toString: (Macaulay2Doc)toString,
  * Usage: 
        toString e
  * Inputs:
      * e, an *note entry from the Kreuzer-Skarke database: KSEntry,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note string: (Macaulay2Doc)String,, 

Description
===========

Returns the underlying string of the given entry from the Kreuzer-Skarke
database.

+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : e = KSEntry "4 5  M:53 5 N:9 5 H:3,43 [-80] id:0|
|       1   0   2   4 -10                             |
|       0   1   3   5  -9                             |
|       0   0   4   0  -4                             |
|       0   0   0   8  -8                             |
|       ";                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : toString e                                      |
|                                                     |
|o2 = 4 5  M:53 5 N:9 5 H:3,43 [-80] id:0             |
|       1   0   2   4 -10                             |
|       0   1   3   5  -9                             |
|       0   0   4   0  -4                             |
|       0   0   0   8  -8                             |
|                                                     |
+-----------------------------------------------------+

